cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Offlined Seafloor, please credit it as below, together with GEBCO."
type: dataset
title: "Offlined Seafloor"
abstract: >-
  The relief of the ocean floor offline: the GEBCO 2026 Grid as Terrarium raster-dem PMTiles, and the
  5,311 named undersea features of the IHO-IOC GEBCO Gazetteer with their depths and, from Wikidata,
  names and Wikipedia articles in 10 languages. A project of Offlined. Not for navigation.
